# The remaining falses are the certifier being conservative, not a finding:
# false has always meant "no proof within bounds" here. The 103, the 106, the
# 108 and the 113 defeat its junk and continuation heuristics within its
# depth; the record pair recurses on chains — what RGEN and GEN-TREE close in
# the eager system, which the pair's divergence keeps it out of — and the 78
# passes the loop itself for an accumulator besides. All eight run at all
# only because the certifier reduces over spines (src/quoted/spine.lamb):
# reading the 103 and the 106 through the term-rebuilding evaluator did not
# come back under this build's eager runner, which made the analysis a
# program this repository could not run on its own subject matter.
#
# For the 100 and the 104 the count claim is proven above. For the other six
# nothing here establishes they are `size`; what is left of that claim is a
# smoke test or two apiece below — `_deep_bug` in src/certify/test.lamb is
# not `size`, and returns 5 on id too. The record pair stands additionally on
# being, node for node, the trees #23 reports fuzz-tested, which the ternary
# readbacks above pin down.
_to_string = Snat.to_string
Reflect.lazy_eval size__smallest__wn id
# = 5
Reflect.lazy_eval size__wn_78 _fork_self
